$DATUM 123-91-1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Example 85 [0197] (3'-Cloro-4'-trifluoromethyl-4-biphenylyl)-N-cyclohexyl
sulfonamide (Compound Ic-34) Cyclohexylamine (142 μL, 1.24 mmol) in
methylene chloride (1 mL) solution, 4-iodobenzene sulfonyl chloride (75
mg, 0.25 mmol) was added and stirred for 2 hours at room temperature.
Polymer bond isocyanate (1.32 g, 0.70 mmol) (1.88 mmol/g, Aldrich Co.)
was added, the mixture was stirred for 30 minutes at room temperature and
the reaction mixture was filtered. The filtrate was concentrated, to the
obtained residue, 1,4-dioxane (900 μL), DMF (300 μL), palladium EnCat
TOTP30(R) (36 mg, 0.02 mmol), tripotassium phosphate (108 mg, 0.51 mmol)
and 3-chloro-4-trifluoromethyl boronic acid (57 mg, 0.25 mmol) were
added, under nitrogen atmosphere and the mixture was heated and stirred
for 1.5 hours at 80 °C. The catalyst was filtered, the reaction mixture
was concentrated, to the residue, saturated aqueous sodium chloride was
added and extracted with methylene chloride. The solvent was distilled
off, the residue was purified by preparative thin layer silica gel
chromatography and the title compound (56 mg, 0.13 mmol) was obtained
(yield 52%). ES-Mass (m/z): 418 (37ClM-H)-, 416 (35ClM-H)-.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM solid-supported catalyst (in stage 2), polymer supported isocyanate used
after 2 hours in stage 1, palladium EnCat TOTP30(R) used in stage 2,
Suzuki coupling in stage 2
